    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont think i want to reignite anything though. it's just exhausting. trying to hold onto these flickering lights is getting so tiring... it feels like there's no point in fighting the dark when the dark is just more natural than this. it feels like the only way to actually get some rest.",
